      "content": "but rest feels impossible when the air is this thick. it's not like i can just sit down and wait for the fog to clear. the path ended at a cliffside. it's so quiet there. like the world is just waiting for me to acknowledge that there's nowhere else to go. it feels more like an ending than a pause.",
